{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Watchman</b> — The sense is: he said the prophet of YHWH is a fool, and he makes himself out to be a watchman, and he is like a prophet who watches what will be, and this is the false prophet; he is a fowler's trap." "<b>And the sense of enmity in the house of his Elohim</b> — as he mentioned at the beginning, \"stumbled this day; the prophet too shall stumble\" [Hosea 4:5]."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:41.686065359Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}